@startmindmap quality-tree

skinparam mindmapDiagram {
  BackgroundColor #ffffff
  RootBackgroundColor #08427B
  RootFontColor #ffffff
  RootFontSize 16
  RootFontStyle bold
}

skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #1168BD
  BorderColor #08427B
  FontColor #ffffff
  FontSize 12
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam leafNode {
  BackgroundColor #438DD5
  BorderColor #1168BD
  FontColor #ffffff
  FontSize 10
}

title Quality Requirements — FHS

* **Quality**
** **1. Correctness**
*** VaR 95% within +/-1% across runs
*** Reproducible results via seed
** **2. Usability**
*** First assessment <15 min
*** Plain-language EUR results
** **3. Performance**
*** 10,000 scenarios <2s
*** Portfolio analysis <10s
** **4. Maintainability**
*** New distribution = one module change
*** All logic in library, not notebooks

@endmindmap
